  local dest="$1"
  cat > "$dest/MAXQ.txt" <<EOF
Official Catppuccin Mocha Chrome theme.
Web Store ID: ${CHROME_STORE_ID}
https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/catppuccin-chrome-theme-m/${CHROME_STORE_ID}

MaxQ ships this unpacked under:
  ${CHROME_THEME_DIR}

Chrome will not live-apply a theme without chrome://extensions developer
mode ("Load unpacked") or enterprise flags MaxQ will not set. Prove checks
these files on disk and does not fail if Chrome is not showing the theme.

MaxQ never writes Chrome ProxyMode/ProxyServer or any file under
/etc/opt/chrome/policies/managed/.
EOF
}

